Note on the device tree:

  rk3568-board-v10.dts is derived from Rockchip's RK3568 EVB device trees
  (arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3568-evb*.dtsi), which are dual-licensed
  "GPL-2.0+ OR MIT". The SPDX identifier in the file header is preserved.
  Choosing MIT for this repository is compatible with that dual license.

Note on the hardware design:

  The schematic and PCB of this board are derived from a third-party
  open-source hardware project licensed under GNU GPL v3. The modified
  hardware design is published under GPL v3 on OSHWHub, where the original
  author's copyright notice and attribution are retained:

      https://oshwhub.com/alexia0/project_vqrzieuk

  The original author published hardware only, without any firmware or
  software. Everything in this repository (device tree, scripts, docs) is
  written independently and is released under the MIT license above. The
  two licenses apply to different things and do not conflict.
